 Reads boards/<name>/board.json and the CSV file it names ("data", relative to the board's folder) and writes
 boards/<name>/index.html. Rows are grouped into sections by the "section" field and ordered by the earliest date
 in each section; sections whose date has passed go under one fold at the bottom.
+
+Optional board.json settings (all off by default):
+  section.empty        heading for rows with a blank section field (default "Other")
+  section.skip_empty   true: leave out rows with a blank section field
+  section.lasts_days   a section stays current this many days from its date (default 1)
+  section.fold_past    false: never fold sections away by date
+  section.next_label   badge on the first upcoming section (default "Next"; "" for none)
+  row_sort             a date field to order rows by within each section
+  done_label           done rows leave their sections and go under one fold with this label
+  column "date": true  show the field as a date, marked "overdue" if passed and the row isn't done
+  column "format"      text around the value, e.g. "waiting on {}"
+Status and section values are matched ignoring case, so "Done" counts as done and "priya" joins "Priya".
 """
